   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "agent",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Settled.** Every run produces everything; the cut decides what goes out that day.\n\n- **Signals Digest** — every weekday\n- **Weekly Brief** — Monday's cut\n- **Risk Deep-Dive** — first-of-month cut\n\nNothing accumulates across days: Monday's Brief is Monday's numbers, not the week's.\n\n*Open, parked:* a Monday rerun re-cuts a Brief that may already have gone to clients. No answer yet."
   },
