   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "document": "docs/adr/0003-the-review-queue-blocks-publication.md",
    "kind": "control",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**New, and the biggest change to the shape of this pipeline.** Sub-threshold Signals are held in a review queue and a non-empty queue blocks publication — nothing unvetted reaches a client (ADR 0003).\n\nThe consequence for this view: the 06:00 run is **no longer unattended**. A human now sits between scoring and publishing, on a clock, before the open.\n\nClick through for what happens inside."
   },
